# Normalize line endings: store text as LF in the repo and check it out as LF on
# every OS, regardless of the user's core.autocrlf. This keeps the working tree
# byte-identical across platforms so Biome's formatter (and CI) behave the same
# everywhere — without it, a Windows checkout gets CRLF and `pnpm run check` fails
# on the lint step.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never apply end-of-line conversion.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
